sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Agent as AI Agent / MCP Client
  participant MCP as MCP Server :8765
  participant Client as REST Client
  participant API as Go API :8080
  participant Store as Store
  participant DB as pet.db

  Agent->>MCP: POST /mcp · tools/call "list_pets"
  MCP->>MCP: 参数校验 + 组装查询
  MCP->>Client: list_pets(query)
  Client->>API: GET /api/v1/pets?...
  API->>Store: List(Query)
  Store-->>API: Result（内存索引）
  API-->>Client: 200 · JSON 信封
  Client->>Client: 拆信封 + Pydantic 校验
  Client-->>MCP: PetListData
  MCP-->>Agent: structuredContent

  Note over Store,DB: 启动时已回放 pet.db 到内存；列表查询不再读盘
  Note over Client,API: 超时 / 5xx / 非法 JSON：有限重试 + 错误归类，最终 isError=true
